{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52936","headline":"奉赠贺郎诗一首 · 高适","name":"奉赠贺郎诗一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"报[贺]（驾）郎，莫潜藏。\n障门终不免，何用漫思量。\n清酒浓如鸡，臛㹠与白羊。\n不论空蒜酢，兼要好椒姜。\n姑娣能无语，多言有侍娘。\n不知何日办，急共妇平章。\n如其意不决，请问阿耶娘。\n（见伯二九七六卷）（按：原卷连录四首诗，不署作者。\n前三首爲《自蓟北归》、《宴别郭尚书》、《题李别驾壁》〖原卷缺题〗皆高适作，疑此诗亦爲其所作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}